WEBVTT

00:00:06.060 --> 00:00:06.860
Oops!

00:00:16.060 --> 00:00:17.260
Isn't this...?

00:02:03.620 --> 00:02:04.850
You there, Rikka?

00:02:04.850 --> 00:02:05.640
I am.

00:02:06.220 --> 00:02:07.250
Can I come in?

00:02:07.250 --> 00:02:08.110
Yes.

00:02:09.830 --> 00:02:13.640
Sorry. I heard a noise, so I 
thought you went out again.

00:02:14.990 --> 00:02:17.230
The air is thick and heavy. Danger.

00:02:17.230 --> 00:02:18.650
Defense turn.

00:02:18.990 --> 00:02:21.360
I don't know what's wrong, but go to sleep.

00:02:21.710 --> 00:02:22.910
We have to be up early.

00:02:27.990 --> 00:02:31.000
At that time, I was still completely unaware.

00:02:31.950 --> 00:02:35.070
I was unaware that Rikka was on 
the verge of losing her power.

00:02:39.270 --> 00:02:44.640
SUN BLOCK

00:02:39.510 --> 00:02:42.310
Schwing! This year I have put up a barrier...

00:02:42.310 --> 00:02:44.640
...to protect me from the 
attack of the Light Beings!

00:02:45.030 --> 00:02:47.470
What happened last year will be repeated!

00:02:47.080 --> 00:02:51.220
EPISODE IX "Resort - Last Resort"

00:02:47.470 --> 00:02:49.270
This place sure is crowded.

00:02:49.270 --> 00:02:51.630
It's oozing with rotten commoner scum.

00:02:51.630 --> 00:02:54.950
Enjoy your petty potato-scrubbing existences.

00:02:54.950 --> 00:02:58.980
Ahoy! Togashi! Rikka!

00:02:56.270 --> 00:02:57.740
THE NAPPING PLACE

00:03:00.550 --> 00:03:02.740
Wow, this place is pretty big.

00:03:02.990 --> 00:03:06.240
This cafe was named
with you in mind, Kumin-senpai.

00:03:04.790 --> 00:03:07.040
THE NAPPING PLACE Beach Cafe

00:03:07.150 --> 00:03:08.590
Hero!

00:03:09.120 --> 00:03:10.870
THE NAPPING PLACE Beach Cafe

00:03:11.270 --> 00:03:12.750
Shichimiya! You're here?!

00:03:12.990 --> 00:03:14.080
I invited her.

00:03:14.350 --> 00:03:15.230
What?

00:03:15.230 --> 00:03:18.210
The more reinforcements 
the better. And besides...

00:03:18.310 --> 00:03:19.300
Besides?

00:03:19.830 --> 00:03:20.800
It's nothing.

00:03:25.510 --> 00:03:29.150
I'll introduce you. This is my aunt.

00:03:29.150 --> 00:03:30.540
Pleased to meet you.

00:03:30.540 --> 00:03:32.810
Thank you for looking after Kumin.

00:03:32.930 --> 00:03:34.750
These are all my friends.

00:03:34.750 --> 00:03:37.440
This is Togashi and his little sister Kuzuha.

00:03:37.560 --> 00:03:39.860
And these are Rikka and Deko.

00:03:40.230 --> 00:03:42.580
Shichimiya and Mori Summer.

00:03:42.580 --> 00:03:43.330
Mori?!

00:03:44.790 --> 00:03:46.840
H- Hello, I'm Nibutani.

00:03:48.850 --> 00:03:50.450
This brings back memories, Morisummer!

00:03:50.790 --> 00:03:55.080
We once attempted to summon a 
siren at a beach just like this!

00:03:55.080 --> 00:03:57.200
You just keep quiet!

00:03:57.200 --> 00:04:01.050
Thank you for coming out all 
this way just to help out.

00:04:01.050 --> 00:04:05.220
My silly husband put his back 
out. He is such a scatterbrain.

00:04:05.420 --> 00:04:09.000
No, we should thank you for 
letting us stay at your house.

00:04:09.000 --> 00:04:12.960
I'm actually worried whether 
we'll be any help to you.

00:04:12.960 --> 00:04:15.980
Don't worry. We have all the things we need.

00:04:16.290 --> 00:04:19.310
And besides, we never made much 
money from this venture...

00:04:19.310 --> 00:04:21.110
...so don't worry if we don't get customers.

00:04:21.360 --> 00:04:23.300
I'm leaving it in your hands!

00:04:23.300 --> 00:04:24.330
Yes, ma'am!

00:04:24.330 --> 00:04:28.020
She is everything I expected your 
aunt to be, Kumin-senpai.

00:04:28.020 --> 00:04:30.220
Okay! Let's all get cracking!

00:04:31.380 --> 00:04:34.120
Let's see. So here's the menu.

00:04:34.420 --> 00:04:36.060
Shaved ice, juice...

00:04:36.060 --> 00:04:37.100
Okay, I think I'll...

00:04:37.100 --> 00:04:40.900
Big brother, you go over there 
and do the prep work. I'll help!

00:04:40.900 --> 00:04:41.840
Yes, ma'am.

00:04:42.100 --> 00:04:45.970
Okay, then Shichimiya, Takanashi, 
and the freshman will...

00:04:45.980 --> 00:04:47.580
Do not order me around!

00:04:47.580 --> 00:04:50.140
Leave it to me! Today, the devil is confined!

00:04:50.140 --> 00:04:53.480
I am a magical girl working 
for the happiness of others!

00:04:54.980 --> 00:04:56.380
It's... It's Kyle.

00:04:56.380 --> 00:04:57.730
Later!

00:05:01.740 --> 00:05:04.100
Get your cold juice and shaved ice!

00:05:04.100 --> 00:05:05.340
Get our special yakisoba...

00:05:05.340 --> 00:05:08.530
...and all your boat and 
inner tube rental needs here!

00:05:08.540 --> 00:05:13.540
WELCOME

00:05:08.820 --> 00:05:10.700
Mommy, I want to have that!

00:05:10.700 --> 00:05:11.980
Behave yourself.

00:05:11.980 --> 00:05:13.540
They're all very good.

00:05:14.140 --> 00:05:15.140
What do you say?

00:05:15.140 --> 00:05:16.960
We'll give you a freebie with your order.

00:05:16.960 --> 00:05:17.900
Really?

00:05:17.900 --> 00:05:20.860
How could we not, Lady? 
You're too sweet to resist!

00:05:21.500 --> 00:05:22.660
Oh, please!

00:05:22.660 --> 00:05:26.420
She's always been skillful 
at negotiating like that.

00:05:23.180 --> 00:05:25.180
It's the truth.

00:05:25.180 --> 00:05:27.580
Hmm, maybe I will have one.

00:05:26.420 --> 00:05:28.060
This is a lifesaver!

00:05:27.580 --> 00:05:31.060
What? Really? That's 
great! Thank you so much!

00:05:28.460 --> 00:05:31.060
Deko and the others are also working hard.

00:05:31.180 --> 00:05:31.460
COLA

00:05:31.420 --> 00:05:35.770
Your order is served! Dark 
gunpowder discharge juice!

00:05:34.980 --> 00:05:36.420
COLA

00:05:36.420 --> 00:05:40.810
Your order is served! Dark 
fried netherworld crustacean!

00:05:41.080 --> 00:05:43.530
Don't change the names of the merchandise.

00:05:46.940 --> 00:05:49.410
It will be ready shortly.

00:05:49.580 --> 00:05:51.040
That's amazing.

00:05:51.040 --> 00:05:54.780
Everyone said that her yakisoba was 
good when they had it at our house...

00:05:55.620 --> 00:05:57.900
...but I didn't know it was this good.

00:05:57.900 --> 00:06:00.300
I'm going to help out a little.

00:06:00.300 --> 00:06:01.710
Oh, thanks.

00:06:02.500 --> 00:06:05.590
So, what exactly are you doing?

00:06:05.660 --> 00:06:06.800
Done.

00:06:07.240 --> 00:06:09.600
Dark Niflheimr Mountain.

00:06:10.100 --> 00:06:11.620
What are you putting on that?

00:06:11.620 --> 00:06:13.700
Dark breath of Kraken.

00:06:13.700 --> 00:06:14.980
Squid ink?

00:06:14.980 --> 00:06:16.300
Some call it that.

00:06:16.300 --> 00:06:17.900
Don't give me that!

00:06:17.900 --> 00:06:20.630
Stop playing with food and 
work like the rest of us!

00:06:20.920 --> 00:06:23.770
Excuse me, can I have a cappuccino?

00:06:23.770 --> 00:06:25.750
Mom, I want the fried squid!

00:06:25.750 --> 00:06:27.400
Squid again?

00:06:27.590 --> 00:06:29.410
Why don't you give octopus 
a try once in a while?

00:06:29.410 --> 00:06:31.280
But I like squid!

00:06:31.500 --> 00:06:33.030
You are Toka, aren't you?

00:06:33.740 --> 00:06:34.990
Toka Takanashi!

00:06:37.000 --> 00:06:38.530
Ow.

00:06:38.740 --> 00:06:41.210
Do not shout out people's names like that.

00:06:41.860 --> 00:06:43.620
So it is you.

00:06:45.940 --> 00:06:48.820
You qualify. Want to come to Italy?

00:06:48.820 --> 00:06:49.780
What?!

00:06:49.780 --> 00:06:52.590
Please do not determine the 
future of my little sister.

00:06:54.740 --> 00:06:56.560
When did you arrive back in Japan?

00:06:57.060 --> 00:06:58.720
You could have called.

00:06:59.180 --> 00:07:00.940
It seemed like too much bother.

00:07:02.080 --> 00:07:04.260
Is that the famous Priestess?

00:07:04.260 --> 00:07:06.380
No, she may be an imposter.

00:07:06.380 --> 00:07:10.000
We cannot rule out the possibility 
she is a detached separate entity!

00:07:11.280 --> 00:07:12.200
You're wide open!

00:07:13.380 --> 00:07:15.620
Master, are you all right?!

00:07:15.620 --> 00:07:16.670
Toka!

00:07:18.980 --> 00:07:19.790
Cute!

00:07:20.020 --> 00:07:22.180
Um, who is that girl?

00:07:22.490 --> 00:07:23.390
Who, this?

00:07:25.700 --> 00:07:27.170
She's my daughter.

00:07:30.170 --> 00:07:30.900
THE NAPPING PLACE Beach Cafe

00:07:30.340 --> 00:07:32.820
What?!

00:07:33.180 --> 00:07:34.660
She'll be seven this year.

00:07:35.060 --> 00:07:36.540
S- Seven?

00:07:36.540 --> 00:07:39.500
How old were you when you had her?

00:07:39.500 --> 00:07:42.420
Let me think. I must've been 17 or 18.

00:07:42.770 --> 00:07:44.650
Y-You are joking, aren't you?

00:07:44.860 --> 00:07:45.650
I am.

00:07:47.300 --> 00:07:50.360
It's an Italian joke. Surprised?

00:07:51.300 --> 00:07:52.340
Why don't you laugh?

00:07:52.340 --> 00:07:53.670
You can't laugh at that!

00:07:54.700 --> 00:07:56.740
Your training manager's daughter?

00:07:57.060 --> 00:07:58.410
Her name is Cento.

00:07:58.910 --> 00:08:01.160
She nuts about Japanese historical dramas.

00:08:01.160 --> 00:08:03.820
She demanded I bring her along 
on one of my trips to Japan.

00:08:03.820 --> 00:08:05.340
You're mine!

00:08:05.580 --> 00:08:07.880
So that's why she talks like that.

00:08:08.100 --> 00:08:11.920
Toka! What is that? Is her eye hurt?

00:08:11.940 --> 00:08:13.820
No, she's just stupid.

00:08:13.820 --> 00:08:15.260
Ooh, stupid!

00:08:15.260 --> 00:08:17.020
That is Wicked Lord Shingan.

00:08:17.020 --> 00:08:19.680
It contains incredible hidden power.

00:08:19.940 --> 00:08:22.060
Wicked Lord Shingan is all-powerful.

00:08:23.660 --> 00:08:25.900
Wicked Lord Shingan, I challenge thee!

00:08:25.900 --> 00:08:28.400
I knew it. You are my foe.

00:08:28.540 --> 00:08:32.030
This sword can drive out evil! 
Try to block it if you dare!

00:08:32.220 --> 00:08:33.280
It can drive out evil?!

00:08:33.500 --> 00:08:37.250
You are an assassin from the Mage's 
Association sent by the Priestess.

00:08:37.780 --> 00:08:39.950
I, Dekomori, am joining the battle!

00:08:40.180 --> 00:08:42.830
For some reason, the conversation 
flows so smoothly between them.

00:08:43.100 --> 00:08:44.420
Here I come!

00:08:45.500 --> 00:08:46.540
Look out!

00:08:46.540 --> 00:08:48.290
I thought I was gonna be death-ed!

00:08:48.290 --> 00:08:50.910
No! That's not how you intercept it!

00:08:50.910 --> 00:08:52.300
You go like this!

00:08:52.420 --> 00:08:53.380
Like this?

00:08:53.380 --> 00:08:56.630
Surely that is an easy task with the 
power of Wicked Lord Shingan.

00:08:56.630 --> 00:08:58.050
Actually...

00:08:58.050 --> 00:09:01.430
THE NAPPING PLACE Beach Cafe

00:08:58.300 --> 00:09:00.220
And she doesn't know how to answer?

00:09:00.220 --> 00:09:01.430
Well, of course.

00:09:01.620 --> 00:09:04.980
Okay. I, Sophia, will accept 
that sword challenge...

00:09:04.980 --> 00:09:08.020
...to illustrate the power 
of the magical devil girl!

00:09:08.170 --> 00:09:08.980
Who, you?

00:09:08.980 --> 00:09:11.300
Hold it! Do not steal our thunder!

00:09:11.300 --> 00:09:13.500
My master's Wicked Lord 
Shingan is all-powerful!

00:09:13.500 --> 00:09:15.610
It is not your place to interfere!

00:09:15.780 --> 00:09:17.360
Isn't that right, Master?

00:09:17.360 --> 00:09:19.100
What? Y-Yes, of course.

00:09:19.100 --> 00:09:21.870
Master, show her how it's done!

00:09:21.940 --> 00:09:23.580
What? Uh...

00:09:24.000 --> 00:09:29.000
THE NAPPING PLACE Beach Cafe

00:09:24.180 --> 00:09:26.180
Shouldn't you ought to step in?

00:09:26.180 --> 00:09:28.580
She's up against a little 
kid. She'll be fine.

00:09:29.440 --> 00:09:30.840
I am coming.

00:09:32.440 --> 00:09:35.280
My master can catch that blindfolded!

00:09:36.440 --> 00:09:37.840
Give it your best shot!

00:09:38.010 --> 00:09:39.250
W- Wait!

00:09:40.120 --> 00:09:41.920
I will release my power so 
you may know to your peril...

00:09:41.920 --> 00:09:44.000
...the terror of the Wicked Lord Shingan.

00:09:44.000 --> 00:09:46.890
Ooh, Master! Are you actually serious?!

00:09:47.600 --> 00:09:50.280
I can witness the true power of 
the real Wicked Lord Shingan!

00:09:50.400 --> 00:09:54.350
A- All battles must be treated 
seriously in any situation.

00:09:55.120 --> 00:09:57.200
Dekomori, stand back and watch.

00:09:58.720 --> 00:09:59.540
Come.

00:10:01.520 --> 00:10:02.310
I am coming.

00:10:02.920 --> 00:10:04.080
Be destroyed, real.

00:10:05.240 --> 00:10:06.620
Blow up, synapses.

00:10:07.960 --> 00:10:09.170
Vanishment...

00:10:10.360 --> 00:10:12.800
...This World!

00:10:15.920 --> 00:10:18.130
Thank you for your hard work today!

00:10:18.360 --> 00:10:20.600
I'm sorry it's so cramped.

00:10:20.600 --> 00:10:22.440
Please don't mind us.

00:10:22.440 --> 00:10:23.880
Mjolnir Tornado!

00:10:23.480 --> 00:10:25.270
Ow! What the hell?!

00:10:25.480 --> 00:10:28.400
Morisummer! Do you want this 
hypnoworm I caught on the beach?

00:10:28.400 --> 00:10:30.190
That's a wharf roach!

00:10:30.640 --> 00:10:32.600
No, it's a hypnoworm.

00:10:32.800 --> 00:10:33.690
Rikka?

00:10:34.880 --> 00:10:35.900
You okay?

00:10:36.600 --> 00:10:37.640
Yeah.

00:10:37.640 --> 00:10:38.440
I see.

00:10:39.010 --> 00:10:41.650
Well, I'm going to sleep over 
there. See you tomorrow.

00:10:44.640 --> 00:10:46.960
You aren't wearing your eye patch.

00:10:49.800 --> 00:10:52.380
You never put it back on when 
you took it off this evening.

00:10:54.080 --> 00:10:55.660
Just rest up tonight.

00:11:03.640 --> 00:11:05.930
INCOMING TEXT/NTOKA

00:11:04.200 --> 00:11:05.250
Toka?

00:11:15.480 --> 00:11:17.320
You're here as well?

00:11:21.200 --> 00:11:22.450
You're late.

00:11:23.420 --> 00:11:25.200
What is it that couldn't wait?

00:11:25.360 --> 00:11:29.950
Well, I don't come to Japan very 
often, so I thought I'd ask.

00:11:30.240 --> 00:11:32.330
What do you intend to do after this?

00:11:32.880 --> 00:11:37.090
From what I can see, not much has 
changed since I left for Italy.

00:11:37.920 --> 00:11:41.470
Rikka is still the same, and so are you.

00:11:41.760 --> 00:11:45.820
I came prepared for all sorts of scenarios.

00:11:45.820 --> 00:11:46.680
Prepared?

00:11:46.680 --> 00:11:47.720
Of course.

00:11:48.060 --> 00:11:50.860
I permitted my little sister 
to live with her boyfriend.

00:11:50.860 --> 00:11:54.540
True, but something did change.

00:11:54.700 --> 00:11:55.730
Really?

00:11:56.020 --> 00:11:58.140
She gave me a peck on the cheek.

00:11:59.740 --> 00:12:02.060
And you're satisfied with that?

00:12:02.060 --> 00:12:04.520
Nibutani asked me a similar question.

00:12:04.980 --> 00:12:07.720
When I became aware of what Rikka sees...

00:12:07.720 --> 00:12:09.980
...and what she persues, it made me think.

00:12:10.740 --> 00:12:12.900
The elusive thing that she is pursuing...

00:12:12.900 --> 00:12:15.670
...is probably the same thing I gave up on.

00:12:15.860 --> 00:12:18.050
It's probably the same thing that I lost.

00:12:19.300 --> 00:12:24.190
That's why I want to be around 
to see what she does next.

00:12:24.940 --> 00:12:27.890
I think that's what I like about her.

00:12:28.740 --> 00:12:30.620
You're very easygoing.

00:12:30.620 --> 00:12:31.820
Do you think so?

00:12:31.820 --> 00:12:33.770
Yeah, it makes me sleepy.

00:12:36.300 --> 00:12:37.150
Say.

00:12:37.380 --> 00:12:38.270
Yes?

00:12:38.700 --> 00:12:42.330
Are you disappointed? Or are you relieved?

00:12:43.430 --> 00:12:46.620
Good question. I'm disappoint-elieved.

00:12:49.780 --> 00:12:52.870
Be destroyed, real. Blow up, synapses.

00:12:52.980 --> 00:12:56.000
Vanishment, This World!

00:12:57.980 --> 00:12:59.530
My power isn't working.

00:13:02.380 --> 00:13:05.230
You look perplexed, Wicked Lord Shingan!

00:13:05.230 --> 00:13:06.220
Shichimiya.

00:13:06.220 --> 00:13:08.890
Let me guess. Is your power fading?

00:13:09.530 --> 00:13:13.390
You summoned me the last time because 
you couldn't fight then either.

00:13:13.640 --> 00:13:16.480
No, that was merely a compatibility issue!

00:13:16.480 --> 00:13:18.400
Don't try to fool me.

00:13:18.400 --> 00:13:20.400
Not only are you losing your power...

00:13:20.400 --> 00:13:24.200
...at times the Wicked Lord 
Shingan fades into oblivion.

00:13:24.200 --> 00:13:25.030
Tell me I'm wrong.

00:13:25.800 --> 00:13:29.190
A little more drains away each time 
you seek out the netherworld...

00:13:29.190 --> 00:13:30.860
...at night with the power of the moon.

00:13:31.340 --> 00:13:32.750
I...

00:13:34.520 --> 00:13:37.520
I knew it. I was the same way.

00:13:38.000 --> 00:13:40.120
That's why you invited me, right?

00:13:40.130 --> 00:13:41.680
Yes! What'll I do?

00:13:41.680 --> 00:13:43.000
You admit it?

00:13:43.000 --> 00:13:45.720
But my power really is fading!

00:13:45.720 --> 00:13:48.040
I sometimes forget about 
Wicked Lord Shingan!

00:13:48.040 --> 00:13:50.180
It's tedious to contain 
him! I want to take it off!

00:13:51.520 --> 00:13:53.640
Then take it off.

00:13:53.640 --> 00:13:58.340
Take it off, and trade your power 
for a stronger Lover's Pact.

00:13:59.880 --> 00:14:00.810
But I...

00:14:01.160 --> 00:14:03.990
That may be what Hero wants.

00:14:04.440 --> 00:14:05.690
Yuta?

00:14:11.560 --> 00:14:14.220
I understand. I was the same.

00:14:14.520 --> 00:14:15.330
Sophia.

00:14:16.080 --> 00:14:18.960
Do you want to revive the Dark 
Flame Dragon above all else?

00:14:19.520 --> 00:14:22.240
Do you want to regain the power 
of Wicked Lord Shingan?

00:14:22.800 --> 00:14:27.470
I am under contract with 
Yuta from time immemorial.

00:14:27.880 --> 00:14:28.840
I must.

00:14:29.360 --> 00:14:30.340
The token.

00:14:30.550 --> 00:14:32.790
I found it in Yuta's room.

00:14:34.700 --> 00:14:38.710
Listen, Wicked Lord Shingan. 
Let me see how you truly feel.

00:14:38.710 --> 00:14:40.540
Show me your true power!

00:14:40.540 --> 00:14:42.660
Then I will let you have this.

00:14:42.660 --> 00:14:43.580
Sophia.

00:14:43.580 --> 00:14:46.500
However, in order to revive 
the Dark Flame Dragon...

00:14:46.500 --> 00:14:49.740
...and in accordance to the logic 
of the world and its natural laws...

00:14:50.100 --> 00:14:53.370
...you need to be prepared to remain 
the Wicked Lord Shingan for eternity.

00:14:53.660 --> 00:14:57.360
No goodbyes are final, no 
transitions are permanent.

00:14:57.360 --> 00:15:00.140
Time passes in conformance 
to the Samsara Corridor.

00:15:00.140 --> 00:15:03.280
To accomplish this, you may be required...

00:15:03.280 --> 00:15:06.010
...to obliterate your present 
emotions towards Hero.

00:15:06.340 --> 00:15:08.530
Just as I did.

00:15:09.780 --> 00:15:10.820
Make your decision.

00:15:12.020 --> 00:15:14.060
I will be waiting tomorrow morning.

00:15:19.660 --> 00:15:21.140
What do I want?

00:15:23.770 --> 00:15:28.280
THE NAPPING PLACE Beach Cafe

00:15:25.020 --> 00:15:26.740
Time for another day's hard work!

00:15:26.740 --> 00:15:27.680
Togashi!

00:15:28.280 --> 00:15:31.060
Buy a bikini and we'll strip off 30%

00:15:28.280 --> 00:15:32.660
Buy a bikini and we'll strip off 30%!
 What do you think?

00:15:32.820 --> 00:15:34.540
That's pretty clever, but...

00:15:34.540 --> 00:15:37.590
We're gonna rake in the cash today!

00:15:37.590 --> 00:15:39.700
Are we making all that?

00:15:39.700 --> 00:15:43.140
They were raving about this so 
much yesterday, we sold out.

00:15:43.140 --> 00:15:45.670
Don't worry. I've put the 
word out on the street.

00:15:45.670 --> 00:15:47.500
THE NAPPING PLACE Beach Cafe
TAGS: GOURMET, LUNCH, FOOD

00:15:45.980 --> 00:15:47.500
See? This is our big opportunity!

00:15:47.580 --> 00:15:51.180
Don't you want to become the 
best beach cafe on the beach?

00:15:51.180 --> 00:15:52.120
Not really.

00:15:52.880 --> 00:15:56.280
You lack greed, girl! 
You're just like Togashi.

00:15:56.280 --> 00:15:59.590
He's too easygoing. Too laid back.

00:15:59.590 --> 00:16:01.530
Morisummer is pumped up.

00:16:01.530 --> 00:16:03.900
Yes, and Kuzuka likes to 
take things in stride.

00:16:03.900 --> 00:16:05.310
In stride?

00:16:05.420 --> 00:16:08.970
She looks very determined to me.

00:16:10.140 --> 00:16:11.570
You think?

00:16:12.950 --> 00:16:15.060
Today I really will catch 
that deep sea monster...

00:16:15.060 --> 00:16:17.530
...and murdalize it once and for all!

00:16:17.530 --> 00:16:19.580
Dekolumpy!

00:16:20.140 --> 00:16:22.040
I am here, Dekolumpy!

00:16:22.220 --> 00:16:24.670
Today, I am your opponent. Come at me!

00:16:25.580 --> 00:16:27.760
It's you, priestess's assassin!

00:16:27.760 --> 00:16:29.800
I will avenge my Master!

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:30.840
Hey.

00:16:30.840 --> 00:16:31.480
Hello.

00:16:34.320 --> 00:16:36.390
Is that all there is to your love?!

00:16:36.680 --> 00:16:38.680
They're very perky first 
thing in the morning.

00:16:38.680 --> 00:16:39.260
Yes.

00:16:41.200 --> 00:16:43.150
Come on, we have customers!

00:16:43.150 --> 00:16:43.890
Oh, right.

00:16:44.070 --> 00:16:46.280
Ooh! My master may need help!

00:16:46.280 --> 00:16:48.440
Master, Dekomori is on her way!

00:16:48.440 --> 00:16:49.440
Wait, you!

00:16:49.720 --> 00:16:52.560
What's wrong? Is that all you 
feel for Wicked Lord Shingan?

00:16:52.560 --> 00:16:54.320
Is that your definition of all-powerful?!

00:16:54.320 --> 00:16:55.360
No.

00:16:55.570 --> 00:16:57.620
Aren't you under contract with Hero?

00:16:58.560 --> 00:17:00.760
Move it, lowly Commoners!

00:17:00.760 --> 00:17:03.260
This is not a show for your amusement!

00:17:03.720 --> 00:17:05.420
Mjolnir Hammer!

00:17:07.520 --> 00:17:08.510
Master!

00:17:09.640 --> 00:17:12.260
Good god! Perfect serenity!

00:17:12.400 --> 00:17:14.510
Now, are you prepared?

00:17:14.750 --> 00:17:17.720
Are you emotionally prepared to force 
the Dark Flame Dragon to manifest?!

00:17:18.520 --> 00:17:19.510
I am...

00:17:20.260 --> 00:17:21.890
I am who I am now...

00:17:23.920 --> 00:17:26.360
...because Yuta was there for me.

00:17:27.740 --> 00:17:29.000
Be destroyed, real!

00:17:29.520 --> 00:17:30.940
Cherubim aria.

00:17:31.100 --> 00:17:32.440
Blow up, synapses!

00:17:32.440 --> 00:17:33.940
Seraphim, descend!

00:17:34.120 --> 00:17:36.560
Vanishment, This World!

00:17:36.560 --> 00:17:38.480
Physical Linkage!

00:17:42.390 --> 00:17:43.370
What is this?

00:17:43.480 --> 00:17:46.750
My master's consciousness is flowing in.

00:17:47.190 --> 00:17:51.060
Yuta once told me that 
our contract is unique.

00:17:51.720 --> 00:17:53.510
I will hesitate no longer!

00:17:55.600 --> 00:17:59.240
Personal engine activation 
confirmed. System released.

00:17:59.850 --> 00:18:03.380
Pressure rising. Pressure increase, 
connection within acceptable levels.

00:18:03.380 --> 00:18:05.140
System all green.

00:18:05.240 --> 00:18:07.390
Commencing core energy supply.

00:18:07.390 --> 00:18:10.640
Lock bolt partitions one 
through three released.

00:18:10.640 --> 00:18:14.260
Bio energy injection. Commence EQ connection.

00:18:14.530 --> 00:18:18.320
Wicked Lord Shingan reinstall 
completion countdown.

00:18:18.320 --> 00:18:20.870
3, 2, 1...

00:18:21.040 --> 00:18:23.990
Rikka Takanashi, entering renewal mode.

00:18:24.840 --> 00:18:26.000
Master.

00:18:27.440 --> 00:18:30.250
Upgrade!

00:18:33.200 --> 00:18:34.270
What?

00:18:34.930 --> 00:18:39.010
Full armored Wicked Lord Shingan 
Schwartz Crustacea is here!

00:18:39.540 --> 00:18:41.360
I caused you all to worry.

00:18:41.860 --> 00:18:44.420
I became dependent upon 
Dark Flame Master's kindness...

00:18:44.420 --> 00:18:46.500
...and I was on the verge 
of losing my own power.

00:18:47.260 --> 00:18:50.480
I very nearly lost the precious thing...

00:18:50.790 --> 00:18:52.970
...I only found with his help.

00:18:53.690 --> 00:18:55.780
But I will never let it go again!

00:18:56.140 --> 00:18:59.530
Yuta believed in me, and so 
I will believe in myself!

00:18:59.860 --> 00:19:01.780
I release the New Wicked Lord Shingan!

00:19:02.280 --> 00:19:04.790
Super-dimensional Purgatorial Fascination!

00:19:14.500 --> 00:19:17.230
The Wicked Lord Shingan 
is gracefully restored!

00:19:17.230 --> 00:19:18.550
Ooh!

00:19:18.780 --> 00:19:20.700
The idiocy is spreading.

00:19:20.700 --> 00:19:21.930
Huh? Oh, yeah.

00:19:22.540 --> 00:19:25.430
That's Satone Shichimiya. 
She's my childhood friend.

00:19:25.700 --> 00:19:29.440
She's kind of like my chunibyo guru.

00:19:32.690 --> 00:19:35.070
ITALIAN YAKISOBA VS JAPANESE YAKISOBA
 - YAKISOBA EVENT (URGENT!!)

00:19:32.940 --> 00:19:35.070
Can we really leave them to it?

00:19:35.380 --> 00:19:39.500
Yeah. I think that they were 
harboring feelings of rivalry.

00:19:40.200 --> 00:19:43.370
Kuzuha may not look it, but 
she has inner fortitude.

00:19:43.620 --> 00:19:45.260
Really.

00:19:47.030 --> 00:19:48.780
Torpedoed!

00:19:48.780 --> 00:19:51.090
Aw, c'mon! Stop that!

00:19:55.180 --> 00:19:57.280
Restored! The Wicked Lord Shingan!

00:19:57.280 --> 00:20:00.100
New and improved, from 
all-powerful to ultra-powerful!

00:20:00.100 --> 00:20:02.470
Yeah, that power was amazing!

00:20:02.770 --> 00:20:06.560
Now, accept this. This now belongs 
to you, Wicked Lord Shingan.

00:20:09.320 --> 00:20:11.600
Are you really prepared for it?

00:20:11.920 --> 00:20:15.580
If you collect all three tokens and 
revive the Dark Flame Dragon...

00:20:15.580 --> 00:20:19.540
...you may have to live out your entire 
life as Wicked Lord Shingan.

00:20:20.140 --> 00:20:21.380
Not as a lover.

00:20:21.380 --> 00:20:23.240
No. Yuta told me.

00:20:23.600 --> 00:20:25.200
The contract you and I are bound to...

00:20:25.200 --> 00:20:27.560
...is not the so-called 
Lover's Pact of the mundanes!

00:20:27.890 --> 00:20:30.070
It is the Lover's Pact of 
Wicked Lord Shingan!

00:20:31.100 --> 00:20:35.190
I will be the eternal Wicked 
Lord Shingan, plus lover!

00:20:35.190 --> 00:20:38.680
That is the ultimate form of the 
contract between Yuta and I.

00:20:38.680 --> 00:20:39.760
You can't do that.

00:20:39.900 --> 00:20:42.420
I can! Yuta said we could.

00:20:42.420 --> 00:20:43.880
He is certain we can fulfill this pact!

00:20:46.180 --> 00:20:49.750
I see. So you can fulfill this pact.

00:20:50.720 --> 00:20:54.800
I will back up your statement, 
as a magical devil girl.

00:20:56.550 --> 00:20:57.290
What is it?

00:20:57.290 --> 00:20:59.780
I just felt a stabbing pain right here.

00:21:00.050 --> 00:21:01.540
Maybe it's static electricity?

00:21:02.140 --> 00:21:04.280
Oh, no! I will heal it with 
the Wicked Lord Shingan.

00:21:05.370 --> 00:21:10.160
And so, I stayed clueless 
as Rikka regained her power.

00:21:12.450 --> 00:21:15.860
And, still unbeknownst to me...

00:21:15.860 --> 00:21:18.430
...something else had begun.

00:21:22.420 --> 00:21:23.980
Yuta.

00:21:30.440 --> 00:21:31.180
What if...

00:21:32.760 --> 00:21:34.150
What if back then...

00:21:34.860 --> 00:21:38.430
...I had taken your hand 
instead of that token?

00:21:41.460 --> 00:21:42.360
It could have been me.

00:21:51.880 --> 00:21:53.080
Huh? Ow.

00:22:00.400 --> 00:22:03.920
What? What?!

00:22:03.920 --> 00:22:05.920
TO BE CONTINUED
